{
  "note": [
    "T24 ground truth for the graph index, ported from rtok's tests/fixtures/graph_truth.toml.",
    "Hand-picked from this repository's C# and labelled from a plain-text scan (class, record, struct,",
    "interface, enum and method declarations for definitions; the name before (, <, ., ',', ')', ';'",
    "or a variable, or after 'new ', ': ' or '[' for references; comment lines and string literals",
    "dropped, nameof(...) not counted), never from the tags index this file scores.",
    "Names that are also a property or field elsewhere (ArchiveId, Manifest, DashboardPage) are left out: a hit there would not prove anything.",
    "defs is complete: every file that defines the name, so precision is computable. refs is a",
    "must-appear subset. No line numbers. Other lanes move code under the labels: a label whose",
    "file no longer mentions the name is skipped, a definition in a file no label names is not judged,",
    "and more than a tenth of labels gone stale fails Most_labels_are_still_backed_by_the_tree;",
    "relabel then and say why here. Repaired once: ConfigFile.cs stopped using AtomicFile, RtokStore",
    "gained the Reads and Usage partial files."
  ],
